d dirtree -- Display a directory's structure in a tree-like format
d 
d Display a directory's contents recursively in a tree-like format in
d Stata's results window, which facilitates you get a really nice and 
d effective overview of the directory's structure.
d 
d KW: workflow
d KW: directory
d KW: folder
d KW: tree
d 
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Version: 1.2
d Distribution-Date: 2026-11-11
d 
d Author:  Yongyi Zeng (Xiamen University, PRC)
d Support: zzyy@xmu.edu.cn
d 
d Author:  Yancheng Chen (Xiamen University, PRC)
d Support: 25120242201569@stu.xmu.edu.cn
d 
d Author:  Bowen Wang (Xiamen University, PRC)
d Support: 34520232201140@stu.xmu.edu.cn

